# native speed ceilings (bench/native_speed_exercise.sh): <workload> <mode> <metric> <ratio>, ratio = native / hosted LLVM
# in the matched mode. A ceiling may only fall: NATIVE_SPEED_LOWER=1 lowers each measured row to its measured ratio and
# adds missing rows; nothing raises one. A row passes while ratio <= ceiling * (1 + scale * noise[metric]).
noise cycles 0.05
noise cpu 0.10
noise instructions 0.02
noise wall 0.10
noise footprint 0.10
